TIP:  Because of Don's singing and guitar cadence the chord for the next line actually comes after the last word in the previous line.  So finish the word, strum, change chord, strum, begin next line.  A little strange I know.

TIP:  In the bridge there's a lone uncomfortable (Caug).  Keep the index finger where it is, and lift the middle and ring fingers and move them each down one string while sliding each back into the 1st and 2nd frets.  Then, if there's time, cover the 5th string/3rd fret with your pinky. 
      

